% Surface predicates are decorated with lemma/pos/sense pulled out of
% the pred name, so an exact word search can use lemma directly.
% Predicates not shaped "_lemma_pos_sense" at all -- e.g. "pron",
% "compound", "unknown" -- get no lemma, so search those by pred
% instead (see the regex snippet). Quantifiers like "_the_q" ARE
% surface-shaped and do get a lemma ("the").

pattern { N [lemma="dog"] }
